==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 20~26 seconds<sup>600f~780f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 30~52 seconds<sup>900f~1,560f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 24 seconds<sup>720f</sup>, delay 30~60 seconds<sup>900f~1,800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawn, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fireworks Guys (Low-Yield)]] spawn after 15 seconds<sup>450f</sup>, delay 30 seconds<sup>900f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 90% HP:
**1 [[Fireworks Guys (High-Yield)]] spawns as the boss.
**3 [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 6~8 seconds<sup>180f~240f</sup>.
**4 [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 6~12 seconds<sup>180f~360f</sup>.
**5 [[Baa Baa]]s spawn, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

